# build scratch — not part of the site
.dl/
.cdp-shot/

# Source photography — 1280px JPEG masters from Pixabay, ~11 MB.
# The site is 100% WebP: every published image lives in assets/webp/ in two
# widths (1280 / 800) and the browser picks one via srcset, so a first visit
# pulls ~300 KB instead of ~970 KB. These JPEG masters are never requested by
# the site, so they stay local and out of the repo. Regenerate both sets with:
#   node scripts/fetch.js && node scripts/convert-all.js
assets/img/

